; OLD REVISION (PEEK #(0,&7FFF) = 130). Ported from the NEW revision's knowledge base
; with tools/romdis/annport.py and checked by hand; notes/PC1600-Old-vs-New.md lists the
; differences. Annotations of code that exists only in the NEW revision are left out.
;
; OVERVIEW
; Bank 6, page 2 (8000H-BFFFH): the display, keyboard, RS-232C and timer IOCS, the
; arithmetic operators, character-code conversion, the 6x8 font and the built-in BASIC
; token table. Page 2 is switched to bank 6 by P0-B0 for every jump-table call that lands
; here (RST 18H 8000H-BFFFH) and by INTHND during interrupts.
; The jump table at 8000H-8122H is the target of the P0-B0 jump-table entries (T_<name>);
; 8087H.. jump to the sound IOCS in this bank (the NEW revision has them in bank 3);
; the RST 18H entries at 8117H.. forward to bank 3 (LCD primitives).
; ============================================================================

; ---- I/O ports ----
P_LH10:     equ 10H     ; LH-5811 compatible block 10H-1FH (base)
P_DIVRST:   equ 14H     ; LH-5811 divider reset
P_SERU:     equ 15H     ; LH-5811 U register (serial rx)
